\v 26 It was to Aharon¦27946 and¦27947 Mosheh¦27947 that¦27945 Yahweh¦27950 had said¦27949, “Bring¦27952 the¦27955 Israelis¦27956 out¦27952 of¦27957 Egypt¦27958 by their¦27961 \add tribes\add*.”
