\v 16 and¦28283 tell¦28283 him¦28284, ‘Yahweh¦28285, the¦28286 god¦28286 of¦28286 the¦28287 Hebrews¦28287, \add previously\add* sent¦28288 me¦28288 to¦28289 you¦28289 to¦28290 say¦28290, “Let¦28291 my¦28294 people¦28294 go¦28291 \add so\add* they¦28295 can serve¦28295 me¦28295 in¦28296 the wilderness¦28296.” But¦28297 listen¦28300, until¦28301 now you haven't \add done it\add*
