\v 23 The Far'oh¦28462 turned¦28461 around and¦28463 went¦28463 \add back to\add* his¦28466 house¦28466, and¦28467 he¦28469 \add ≈put¦28469 all of that¦28473 out of his¦28470 mind¦28470\add*.
\v 24 \add Meanwhile,\add* all¦28476 the Egyptians dug¦28475 holes around¦28479 the¦28480 river¦28480 to get water¦28481 to¦28486 drink¦28486, because¦28483 river water was¦28485 undrinkable.
\s1 Plague 2: Frogs everywhere
