\v 1 and¦28503 \add *he¦28504\add* said¦28503 to¦28505 Mosheh¦28507, “Go¦28508 to¦28509 Far'oh¦28511 and¦28512 tell¦28512 him¦28513, ‘Yahweh¦28516 says¦28515 that¦28521 you \add must\add* let¦28517 my¦28520 people¦28520 go \add so\add* they¦28521 can serve¦28521 me¦28521.\f + \fr 8:1 \ft This is 7:26 in some versifications (and the following three verses are 7:27, 28, & 29).\f*
