\v 3 The frogs¦28542 will¦28540 swarm¦28540 in the¦28541 river¦28541, then¦28543 they'll¦28543 climb¦28543 out and¦28544 go¦28544 into¦28545 your house and¦28546 in¦28546 your¦28547 bedroom¦28546 and¦28548 onto your¦28550 bed¦28550. They'll¦28544 go into¦28551 your¦28552 servants¦28552' houses and¦28553 among your¦28553 people¦28553, and¦28554 in¦28554 your¦28554 \add cooking\add* bowls¦28555 and¦28555 into¦28555 your¦28555 ovens¦28554.
\v 4 They'll¦28563 climb¦28563 on¦28558 you¦28558 and¦28559 on¦28559 your¦28559 people¦28559 and¦28560 on¦28560 all¦28560 your¦28562 servants¦28562.’ ”
