\v 8 Then¦29222 Yahweh¦29223 told¦29222 Mosheh¦29226 and¦29227 Aharon¦29229, “Take¦29230 handfuls of ash out of a¦29235 furnace¦29235, then¦29236 Mosheh¦29237 should \add toss it up in the air in front\add* of¦29239 Far'oh¦29240.
