\v 10 \add ≈So¦29264\add* they¦29264 took¦29264 some ash from a furnace¦29268, and¦29269 standing¦29269 in¦29270 front¦29270 of¦29270 Far'oh¦29271, Mosheh¦29274 \add tossed it up into the air\add* and¦29276 it¦29276 turned into boils¦29277 with bursting¦29279 blisters¦29278 on¦29280 the people¦29280 and¦29281 the animals¦29281.\x + \xo 9:10: \xt Rev 16:2.\x*
