\p
\v 13 Then¦29318 Yahweh¦29319 told¦29318 Mosheh¦29322, “Get up early¦29323 in¦29324 the morning¦29324, and¦29325 stand in¦29326 front¦29326 of¦29326 Far'oh¦29327 and¦29328 say¦29328 to¦29329 him¦29329, ‘This is what Yahweh¦29333, the¦29334 god¦29334 of¦29334 the¦29335 Hebrews¦29335, says¦29332: Let¦29336 my¦29339 people¦29339 go¦29336 so¦29340 they¦29340 can serve¦29340 me¦29340
