\p
\v 22 “Raise your¦29500 arm up toward the¦29503 sky¦29503,” Yahweh¦29493 told¦29492 Mosheh¦29496, “and¦29504 hail¦29505 \add will strike\add* all¦29506 over Egypt¦29509—on¦29510 the¦29512 people¦29512 and¦29513 animals¦29515 and¦29516 on¦29516 every¦29517 plant in the Egyptian¦29522 countryside¦29520.”
