\v 25 The¦29569 hail¦29569 struck¦29568 everything in¦29570 Egypt¦29573—everything that¦29577 was in¦29578 the¦29578 countryside¦29578, from¦29579 people¦29579 to¦29580 animals¦29582. \add It also\add* struck¦29588 every plant and¦29590 broke every¦29592 tree¦29594 \add out\add* in the¦29595 countryside¦29595.
