\v 31 (\add Now\add* the¦29677 flax¦29677 and¦29678 the¦29678 barley¦29678 were¦29679 \add flattened by the hail\add* because¦29680 the¦29681 barley¦29681 was¦29682 \add full grown and starting to fill out\add* and¦29683 the¦29683 flax¦29683 was¦29684 in bloom.
