\v 5 They'll cover¦29837 the¦29840 ground¦29841 so¦29842 that¦29854 no one will¦29843 \add even\add* be¦29843 able¦29843 to see¦29844 it, and they'll devour¦29848 whatever remains¦29854 after the¦29858 hail¦29858. Plus¦29859 they'll devour¦29859 every¦29862 tree¦29864 growing¦29865 in the¦29869 countryside¦29869.
\v 6 They'll¦29871 fill your houses and¦29873 the¦29873 houses¦29873 of¦29873 all¦29874 your¦29876 servants¦29876 and¦29877 the¦29877 houses¦29877 of¦29877 all¦29878 the Egyptians. It'll be nothing like anything which¦29881 your \add parents generation\add* ever saw¦29884, nor anything seen by the¦29886 \add previous generations\add* from¦29888 the¦29888 day¦29888 they¦29889 came to be on¦29890 the¦29892 earth until¦29893 today.” Then¦29896 \add @Mosheh¦29896\add* turned¦29896 around and¦29897 went¦29897 out¦29897 from¦29898 Far'oh¦29899 \add with Aharon\add*.
