\v 7 Then¦29901 Far'oh's¦29903 servants¦29902 \add asked\add* him¦29904, “How much longer is this¦29909 \add going to cause trouble\add* for¦29910 us¦29910? Let¦29912 the¦29915 men¦29915 go¦29912 and they'll¦29916 worship¦29916 their¦29920 god¦29920 Yahweh¦29919. Don't¦29921 you¦29922 understand¦29922 yet¦29921 that¦29923 Egypt¦29925 \add is being destroyed\add*?”
