\p
\v 16 Far'oh¦30130 quickly¦30129 summoned¦30131 Mosheh¦30132 and¦30133 Aharon¦30133 and¦30134 said¦30134, “I've¦30135 sinned¦30135 against your¦30137 god¦30137 Yahweh¦30136 and¦30138 against you¦30138.
