\p
\v 1 \add Now\add* Yetro (Jethro¦33871), the¦33872 priest¦33872 at Midian¦33873 and Mosheh's¦33875 father-in-law¦33874, heard¦33870 about¦33877 everything that¦33879 God¦33881 had¦33880 done¦33880 for¦33882 Mosheh¦33882 and¦33883 for¦33883 his¦33884 people¦33884 the Israelis¦33883—that¦33885 Yahweh¦33888 had¦33887 brought¦33887 \add #the Israelis¦33891\add* out¦33887 of Egypt¦33892.
