\v 16 If a¦36183 man¦36183 entices a¦36184 young¦36184 woman¦36184 who's¦36185 not¦36186 engaged¦36188, and¦36189 sleeps¦36189 with¦36190 her¦36190, he¦36192 must¦36192 certainly¦36191 pay¦36192 the¦36192 bride price \add to her father\add* for¦36192 her¦36192 to¦36194 become his wife¦36194.\x + \xo 22:16-17: \xt Deu 22:28-29.\x*
