\v 21 You mustn't disadvantage or oppress¦36241 any \add ≈foreigner staying in your country\add*, because¦36242 you¦36245 were¦36245 \add ≈foreigners staying\add* in¦36246 the land¦36246 of¦36247 Egypt¦36247.\x + \xo 22:21-22: \xt Exo 23:9; Lev 19:33-34; Deu 24:17-18; 27:19.\x*
