\v 24 and¦36274 \add ≈get angry¦36275\add*. I'll¦36276 \add ≈cause you¦36277 all to die\add* in battle, and¦36279 your¦36280 wives¦36280 will become widows¦36281 and¦36282 your¦36282 children¦36282 will become fatherless¦36283.
