\v 30 plus you¦36370 must¦36370 do¦36370 the same with your¦36371 cattle and your¦36372 sheep¦36372 and goats. The young must stay seven¦36373 days¦36374 with¦36376 \add #their\add* \add #mothers¦36378\add*, then you¦36381 must¦36381 give¦36381 \add #them\add* to¦36383 me¦36383 on the¦36380 eighth¦36380 day¦36379.
