\v 31 You¦36389 must¦36389 be¦36389 \add ≈different from others because you're dedicated to¦36390 me¦36390\add*. \add So\add* you¦36395 mustn't eat¦36395 the meat¦36391 of \add #animals¦36393\add* that are mauled in¦36392 the¦36392 countryside¦36392—throw¦36397 it to the dogs¦36396 \add instead\add*.\x + \xo 22:31: \xt Lev 17:15.\x*
\c 23
