\v 4 If¦36441 you¦36442 come across your¦36444 enemy's¦36444 cow¦36443 or¦36445 donkey¦36446 going astray, you¦36449 must¦36449 certainly¦36448 take it¦36449 back to¦36450 them.\x + \xo 23:4-5: \xt Deu 22:1-4.\x*
