\v 7 Stay far way from¦36475 deceptive words¦36475. You¦36478 mustn't kill¦36483 innocent or honest \add >people\add* because¦36484 I¦36487 won't \add allow\add* wicked¦36488 \add >people\add* to be declared¦36487 innocent.
\v 8 You¦36492 mustn't accept¦36492 \add #bribes\add*, because¦36493 \add #bribes¦36494\add* \add ≈stop people from being unbiased\add* and¦36497 \add #they\add* undermine the¦36498 words¦36498 of¦36498 \add ≈honest\add* \add >people\add*.
