\v 9 You¦36503 mustn't oppress¦36503 \add #foreigners\add* since you \add #yourselves\add* know¦36505 \add ≈how that feels\add* because¦36510 you¦36513 all were¦36513 foreigners in¦36514 Egypt¦36515.\x + \xo 23:9: \xt Exo 22:21; Lev 19:33-34; Deu 24:17-18; 27:19.\x*
