\v 12 Six¦36544 days¦36545 You¦36546 should work¦36547 for six days, then¦36548 on¦36548 the¦36549 seventh¦36549 \add >day\add* you¦36550 must¦36550 rest¦36550 so¦36551 that¦36551 your¦36553 cow¦36553 and¦36554 your¦36554 donkey¦36554 can rest¦36552, and¦36555 the¦36556 \add #children¦36556\add* of¦36556 your¦36558 \add #slaves¦36558\add* and¦36559 the¦36559 foreigner¦36559 \add staying in your land\add* can be refreshed¦36555.\x + \xo 23:12: \xt Exo 20:9-11; 31:15; 34:21; 35:2; Lev 23:3; Deu 5:13-14.\x*
\p
\v 13 \add ≈Take¦36566 careful notice of\add* everything that¦36562 I've¦36564 told¦36564 you¦36565 all. You all mustn't \add invoke\add* other¦36569 gods¦36568—\add in fact\add* \add ≈don't even mention their names¦36567\add*.
