\s1 Promises and teachings
\p
\v 20 Listen, I'm¦36677 about¦36678 to¦36678 send¦36678 a messenger¦36679 \add ≈in front¦36680 of you\add* to¦36681 guard¦36681 you¦36681 on¦36682 the way¦36682, and¦36683 to¦36683 take¦36683 you¦36683 to¦36684 the¦36686 place¦36686 that¦36687 I¦36688 have¦36688 prepared¦36688.
