\v 22 \add But\add* if you¦36710 \add ≈take careful¦36709 notice of¦36711 his¦36711 words¦36711\add* and¦36712 do¦36712 everything that¦36714 I¦36715 say¦36715, then¦36716 I'll¦36716 be¦36716 an¦36716 enemy¦36716 to¦36716 your¦36719 enemies¦36719 and¦36720 I'll¦36720 be against those who are against you.
\v 23 My¦36728 messenger¦36728 will¦36727 go¦36727 \add ≈ahead of you\add* and¦36730 take¦36730 you¦36730 to¦36731 \add face\add* the¦36733 Amorites¦36733, the¦36734 Hittites, the¦36735 Perizzites, the¦36736 Canaanites¦36736, the¦36737 Hivites¦36737, and¦36738 the¦36738 Yebusites¦36738, and¦36739 then I'll¦36739 annihilate¦36739 them.
\v 24 You¦36743 mustn't serve¦36746 or bow¦36743 down¦36743 to¦36744 their¦36744 gods¦36744, and¦36745 you¦36746 mustn't do \add @what¦36746 those¦36746 people¦36746\add* do, because¦36750 you¦36748 must¦36748 completely¦36751 overthrow them¦36752 and¦36753 completely¦36753 smash their \add sacred\add* \add stone\add* pillars¦36755.
\v 25 You¦36757 all must¦36757 worship¦36757 your¦36760 god¦36760 Yahweh¦36759, and¦36761 he'll¦36761 bless¦36761 your¦36764 food¦36764 and¦36765 your¦36767 water¦36767. I'll¦36768 keep sickness¦36769 away from¦36770 you
\v 26 \add and\add* there won't¦36772 be¦36773 \add #any miscarriages¦36774\add* or \add #women\add* in¦36776 your¦36776 land¦36776 that can't conceive. I'll¦36781 ensure \add ≈that you live your full\add* number¦36779 of¦36779 days¦36780.
\p
\v 27 I'll \add ≈go¦36795 ahead of¦36785 you and will terrify¦36785\add* and¦36788 confuse¦36788 all¦36791 of¦36791 the¦36793 people¦36793 \add groups\add* \add ≈whose lands you'll¦36795 enter\add*, and¦36797 I'll¦36797 \add ≈cause them to¦36803 flee from you¦36803 in battle\add*.
\v 28 I'll¦36806 send¦36806 \add #hornets¦36809\add* \add ≈ahead of you\add* and¦36811 \add #they'll\add* drive¦36811 out¦36811 the¦36814 Hivites¦36814, the¦36817 Canaanites, and¦36818 the¦36820 Hittites \add ≈before¦36821 you¦36821 get there\add*.
\v 29 I¦36824 won't¦36823 drive¦36824 them out¦36824 \add ≈more than¦36825 a¦36826 year¦36826 ahead¦36825 of¦36825 you¦36825\add* in¦36826 case the¦36831 area becomes¦36830 desolate¦36832 and¦36833 the¦36835 \add ≈wild animals¦36835 proliferate too much\add* in the¦36836 countryside¦36836.
\v 30 I'll¦36840 drive¦36840 them out¦36840 little by little \add ≈ahead¦36841 of¦36841 you¦36841\add* until¦36842 \add ≈your numbers increase\add* and¦36845 you¦36845 take over the¦36848 land¦36848.
\v 31 Then¦36850 I'll¦36850 \add ≈help you establish\add* your¦36853 \add #borders¦36853\add* from¦36854 the¦36854 Red Sea¦36854 to¦36857 the Mediterranean, and¦36861 from¦36861 the¦36861 wilderness¦36861 to¦36862 the¦36864 \add Euphrates\add* river¦36864, because¦36865 I'll¦36867 \add ≈help you defeat the¦36870 existing\add* inhabitants¦36870 of¦36870 the¦36871 land¦36871 and¦36872 so you'll¦36872 drive¦36872 them¦36872 right out¦36872.
\v 32 You¦36877 mustn't make¦36877 any agreement¦36880 with \add @those¦36878 people¦36878\add* or with their¦36879 gods¦36879.
\v 33 They¦36883 mustn't live¦36883 in¦36884 your¦36884 land¦36884, in case they¦36887 cause¦36887 you to¦36887 sin¦36887 against me¦36889. Their¦36894 gods¦36894 would¦36897 certainly become¦36897 a¦36899 trap¦36899 for you, and then you'd \add end up\add* worshipping them.
\c 24
\s1 The people confirm their agreement
