\v 6 Mosheh¦36999 took¦36998 half¦37000 of¦37000 the¦37001 blood¦37001 \add from the sacrifices\add* and¦37002 put¦37002 it¦37002 into¦37003 basins¦37003. He¦37006 sprinkled¦37006 \add the other\add* half¦37004 of¦37004 the¦37005 blood¦37005 onto the¦37009 altar¦37009.
\v 7 Then¦37011 he¦37011 took¦37011 the¦37012 scroll with the¦37013 agreement¦37013 \add written on it\add* and¦37014 read it¦37014 out loud to the¦37016 people¦37016, and¦37017 they¦37017 \add ≈responded¦37017\add*, “We'll obey¦37024 everything that¦37019 Yahweh¦37022 has¦37021 instructed.”
\p
\v 8 Then¦37026 Mosheh¦37027 took¦37026 the¦37030 blood¦37030 \add in the bowls\add* and¦37031 sprinkled¦37031 it onto the¦37034 people¦37034,\x + \xo 24:8: \xt Heb 9:19-20.\x* telling¦37035 \add <them\add*, “Look. \add This is\add* the¦37037 blood¦37037 \add confirming\add* the¦37039 agreement¦37039\x + \xo 24:8: \xt Mat 26:28; Mrk 14:24; Luk 22:20; 1Cor 11:25; Heb 10:29.\x* that¦37040 Yahweh¦37042 has¦37041 made¦37041 with¦37043 you according to \add ≈what you just heard\add*.”
\rem /s1 On the Mountain with God
