\v 16 Yahweh's¦37160 \add ≈radiance\add* settled¦37157 on¦37161 Mt¦37163. Sinai¦37164, and¦37165 the cloud covered¦37165 it¦37165 for six¦37167 days¦37168, then¦37169 on the¦37174 seventh¦37174 day¦37173 he¦37169 called¦37169 to¦37170 Mosheh¦37172 from¦37175 within the¦37176 cloud¦37176.
\v 17 The appearance¦37178 of¦37179 Yahweh's¦37180 \add ≈radiance\add* was¦37181 like¦37181 a¦37181 \add ≈roaring\add* fire¦37181 on¦37183 the¦37183 top¦37183 of¦37183 the¦37184 mountain¦37184 \add ≈from what the Israelis¦37187 below could see\add*.
\v 18 Then¦37189 Mosheh¦37190 entered \add into\add* the¦37192 cloud¦37192 and¦37193 continued up the¦37196 mountain¦37196, and¦37197 \add *he¦37198\add* remained up there for forty¦37200 full days¦37201.\x + \xo 24:18: \xt Deu 9:9.\x*
\c 25
