\p
\v 5 \add ≈When¦41090\add* Aharon¦41091 saw¦41090 \add <that\add*, he¦41092 built¦41092 an¦41093 altar¦41093 \add ≈in¦41094 front¦41094 of¦41094\add* the bull and announced, “Tomorrow¦41100 will be a¦41098 festival¦41098 to¦41099 \add honour\add* Yahweh¦41099.”
