\v 7 Then¦41116 Yahweh¦41117 \add ≈told¦41116\add* Mosheh¦41120, “Go on down¦41123 because¦41124 your¦41126 people¦41126 that¦41127 you¦41128 brought¦41128 out of¦41129 Egypt¦41130 have¦41125 gone bad—
\v 8 they've¦41132 quickly¦41133 deviated from¦41134 what I¦41138 instructed¦41138 them¦41138. They've¦41139 made¦41139 a¦41141 metal¦41142 bull for themselves and¦41143 have¦41143 bowed¦41143 down¦41143 to¦41145 it¦41145 and¦41146 sacrificed¦41146 to¦41148 it¦41148 and¦41149 they've¦41149 said¦41149, ‘Yisrael¦41152, these¦41150 are¦41151 your¦41151 gods¦41151 that¦41153 brought¦41154 you¦41154 out of¦41155 Egypt¦41156.’ ”
\v 9 Then¦41158 Yahweh¦41159 said¦41158 to¦41160 Mosheh¦41162, “I've¦41163 seen¦41163 this¦41167 people, and¦41168 look¦41168, \add ≈they're so stubborn\add*.
\v 10 \add ≈So¦41176\add* leave¦41177 me alone¦41177 now¦41176 and let my¦41181 anger¦41181 rage against them¦41182. I¦41183 will destroy them¦41183 and¦41184 make¦41184 you¦41185 into¦41186 a¦41186 great¦41187 nation¦41186.”
\v 11 But¦41189 Mosheh¦41190 pleaded with his¦41195 god¦41195 Yahweh and¦41196 \add ≈asked¦41196\add*, “Yahweh¦41198, why¦41197 \add ≈are you angry¦41200 at\add* your¦41200 people¦41201 that¦41202 you¦41203 have brought¦41203 out¦41203 of¦41204 Egypt¦41205 with¦41206 \add ≈your incredible¦41207 power¦41206 and¦41208 actions\add*?\x + \xo 32:11-14: \xt Num 14:13-19.\x*
