\v 21 Then¦41385 Mosheh¦41386 \add ≈demanded from\add* Aharon¦41389, “What¦41390 did¦41392 \add #these\add* people¦41394 do¦41392 to you to make you bring¦41398 such a¦41400 terrible sin¦41400 on them?”
