\p
\v 25 Mosheh¦41460 saw¦41459 that the¦41463 people¦41463 \add ≈were¦41465 out of control\add* because¦41467 Aharon¦41470 had¦41469 let¦41469 \add ≈them go¦41469 wild¦41469\add*, \add and now they were subject\add* to mockery \add ≈from any group that¦41472 stood up\add* against¦41472 them¦41472.
