\r (Exo. 35:10-19)
\p
\v 32 And \add so\add* all¦45376 the¦45378 components of¦45378 the¦45379 residence¦45379, the¦45380 tent¦45380 for meeting¦45381 \add <God\add*, were¦45375 finished¦45375—the¦45383 Israelis¦45384 had¦45387 done just what Yahweh¦45388 had instructed¦45387 Mosheh¦45391.
\v 33 \add @The¦45396 craftsmen¦45396\add* brought¦45396 the¦45399 \add disassembled\add* residence¦45399 to¦45400 Mosheh¦45402—the¦45405 tent¦45405 and¦45406 all¦45408 its equipment¦45410, the clips, the frames¦45412 with their bars¦45413, and¦45415 the pillars¦45415 with their bases¦45416,
\v 34 the reddened rams¦45422 \add #hide\add* tarpaulin and¦45424 the¦45426 top¦45426 sea-cow hide tarpaulin, the¦45430 curtain¦45430 for covering \add <the most sacred place\add*,
\v 35 the¦45435 box¦45435 for the¦45436 transcript¦45436 slabs and¦45437 its¦45439 poles¦45439, the¦45441 atonement¦45441 platform,
\v 36 the¦45445 table¦45445 with all¦45448 its¦45450 utensils¦45450 and¦45451 the¦45452 \add sacred\add* bread¦45452 to present¦45453 to God,
